          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Survival of Better-Adapted Individuals.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Analyze the relationship and given criteria.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: Its inherited characteristics help it survive and reproduce in that environment.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Survival of Better-Adapted Individuals.",
          "subject": "biology",
