          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Plant Cell Walls and Chloroplasts in Classification.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Analyze the relationship and given criteria.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: Cellulose.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Plant Cell Walls and Chloroplasts in Classification.",
