          "why": "Demonstrate clear step-by-step reasoning.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Taxonomic Hierarchy.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Analyze the relationship and given criteria.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: Kingdom → Phylum → Class → Order → Family → Genus → Species.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Taxonomic Hierarchy.",
          "subject": "biology",
