          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Population Size.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Population = 400 + 70 − 30 = 440.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: 440",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Population Size.",
          "subject": "biology",
