          "why": "The method depends on capturing, releasing and later recapturing mobile organisms.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Capture-Mark-Recapture.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: The method depends on capturing, releasing and later recapturing mobile organisms.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: Mobile animals",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Capture-Mark-Recapture.",
          "subject": "biology",
