          "why": "More individuals are added than removed.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Population Growth.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: More individuals are added than removed.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: Births and immigration greater than deaths and emigration",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Population Growth.",
          "subject": "biology",
          "chapter": "ecology",
          "topic": "Population Growth",
          "conceptId": "biology_ecology_population_growth",
          "skillId": "biology_ecology",
          "subskillId": "biology_ecology_q1"
