          "why": "Logistic growth slows as the population approaches carrying capacity.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Logistic Population Growth.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Logistic growth slows as the population approaches carrying capacity.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: S-shaped",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Logistic Population Growth.",
