          "why": "These four processes add or remove individuals from a population.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Human Population Growth.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: These four processes add or remove individuals from a population.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: Births, deaths, immigration and emigration",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Human Population Growth.",
          "subject": "biology",
          "chapter": "ecology",
