          "why": "More people generally require resources such as food, water and energy.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Population Growth and Resource Demand.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: More people generally require resources such as food, water and energy.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: It may increase",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Population Growth and Resource Demand.",
