          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Habitat Destruction.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Habitat destruction removes or damages the conditions organisms require.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: Damage or removal of the place where an organism normally lives",
