          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Biomagnification.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Persistent pollutants can become more concentrated higher in a food chain.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: Increase in concentration of certain persistent pollutants at higher trophic levels",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Biomagnification.",
          "subject": "biology",
