          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Mean, Range and Variation in Ecological Data.",
          "subject": "biology",
          "chapter": "genetics",
          "topic": "Mean, Range and Variation in Ecological Data",
          "conceptId": "biology_genetics_mean_range_and_variation_in_ecological_data",
