          "why": "It is the variable whose effect is being investigated.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Ecological Investigation Variables.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: It is the variable whose effect is being investigated.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: the factor deliberately changed or selected",
