          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Biotic Factors and Species Distribution.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Biotic factors arise from interactions between living organisms.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: an effect caused by living organisms",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Biotic Factors and Species Distribution.",
          "subject": "biology",
          "chapter": "ecology",
          "topic": "Biotic Factors and Species Distribution",
          "conceptId": "biology_ecology_biotic_factors_and_species_distribution",
          "skillId": "biology_ecology",
