          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Large Surface Area of Alveoli.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Many small alveoli create a much larger exchange surface.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: to provide a very large total surface area for gaseous exchange",
