          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Mucus and Cilia in the Airways.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Sticky mucus captures particles in inhaled air.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: to trap dust and microorganisms",
