          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Gas Exchange and Surface Area to Volume Ratio.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: More surface provides more sites for gases to cross.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: it provides more area for diffusion",
