          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Effect of Exercise on Gas Exchange.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Higher respiration rates increase respiratory gas demand and production.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: working muscles require more oxygen and produce more carbon dioxide",
