          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for The Complete Cardiac Cycle.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Analyze the relationship and given criteria.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: Blood enters the atria and flows into the ventricles.",
