          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Recovery of Heart Rate After Exercise.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Analyze the relationship and given criteria.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: It gradually decreases towards the resting heart rate.",
