          "why": "Demonstrate clear step-by-step reasoning.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Comparing Arteries, Veins and Capillaries.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Analyze the relationship and given criteria.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: An artery.",
