          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for photosynthesis_graphs.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: A plateau means the rate is no longer responding significantly to further increases in the tested factor.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: Increasing the tested factor no longer increases the rate",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of photosynthesis_graphs.",
          "subject": "biology",
          "chapter": "photosynthesis",
          "topic": "photosynthesis_graphs",
          "conceptId": "biology_photosynthesis_photosynthesis_graphs",
          "skillId": "biology_photosynthesis",
          "subskillId": "biology_photosynthesis_q1"
