          "why": "The two regions provide a comparison while other conditions can be kept similar.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for photosynthesis_experiment_control.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: The two regions provide a comparison while other conditions can be kept similar.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: To create a comparison between a light-exposed and light-excluded region",
