          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for auxin_and_root_growth.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Roots are highly sensitive to auxin and high concentrations can inhibit elongation.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: It can inhibit root cell elongation",
