          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for plant_growth_curve.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: The gradient shows change in growth measurement per unit time.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: Growth rate",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of plant_growth_curve.",
