          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for plant_growth_measurement_comparison.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Change = 18 − 6 = 12 cm. 12 ÷ 4 = 3 cm/day.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: 3 cm/day",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of plant_growth_measurement_comparison.",
          "subject": "biology",
          "chapter": "plant_growth_and_development",
          "topic": "plant_growth_measurement_comparison",
          "conceptId": "biology_plant_growth_and_development_plant_growth_measurement_comparison",
