          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for seed_viability.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Viability means the seed has the capacity to germinate.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: It is alive and capable of germinating under suitable conditions",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of seed_viability.",
          "subject": "biology",
          "chapter": "plant_growth_and_development",
          "topic": "seed_viability",
          "conceptId": "biology_plant_growth_and_development_seed_viability",
          "skillId": "biology_plant_growth_and_development",
