          "why": "Amylase catalyses the breakdown of starch into smaller sugars.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for enzymes_during_germination.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Amylase catalyses the breakdown of starch into smaller sugars.\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: Starch",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of enzymes_during_germination.",
          "subject": "biology",
          "chapter": "plant_growth_and_development",
