          "sol": "Step 1: Identify key concept: Define the required principles for Anaerobic Respiration & Oxygen Debt.\nStep 2: Apply governing rule: Lactic acid causes muscle cramp\nStep 3: State the final conclusion: Glucose → Lactic acid + Energy",
          "hint": "No oxygen involved",
